# 本项目的 Git 忽略规则：排除本地协作规范、构建产物及敏感配置。

# 本地协作规范，仅保留在本机
/AGENTS.md
/.codex/
/.agents/

# Java / Maven
target/
*.class
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
*.hprof
*.jfr
dependency-reduced-pom.xml
.flattened-pom.xml
pom.xml.versionsBackup
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.next
pom.xml.tag
release.properties
.m2/

# IDEA
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
out/
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.vscode/

# Logs
logs/
*.log
*.log.*
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Local secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!build/.env.securities.example
application-local.yml
application-local.yaml
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.jks

# Local runtime data
/build/.local-run/
mysql-data/
redis-data/
kafka-data/
grafana-data/
prometheus-data/
/backups/

# Frontend dependencies
node_modules/
.npm/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
coverage/
.nyc_output/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
/ui/dist/

# 编辑器临时文件；不全局忽略 SQL、JSON、图片或业务 output 包
*.tmp
*.temp
*.bak
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
